# Build outputs are reproducible — keep the repo lean.
# Committed: scripts, tests, docs, manifests, small sample input (see below).
# Regenerate everything else via: node tools/smoke_greybox.mjs

# Large/regenerable artifacts (do NOT commit)
/data/generated/taipei/worldmodel_sample.json
/data/generated/taipei/*.glb
/data/generated/taipei/*.report.json
/data/generated/taipei/sample_buildings_epsg3826.geojson
/data/generated/taipei/sample_buildings_epsg3826.manifest.json
/godot/greybox/assets/*.glb

# Python noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# UE regenerable junk (never commit)
unreal/Saved/
unreal/Intermediate/
unreal/DerivedDataCache/
unreal/Binaries/

# Small sample input IS committed for reviewer convenience:
#   data/generated/taipei/sample_buildings.geojson (~5 MB)
#   data/generated/taipei/sample_buildings.manifest.json
!data/generated/taipei/sample_buildings.geojson
!data/generated/taipei/sample_buildings.manifest.json
